        {
          "id": "3e0e7d72-c910-4469-bd1c-a1a2f068b3e5",
          "memory": "By October 7, 2026, Alex's basil plant was alive and thriving with six leaves, up from four leaves in late September 2026. User joked pesto was now 8 years away, down from 9 years, continuing their running pesto-timeline joke.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "882649f7-e220-4c38-ba24-9ccc4f5249fe",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, the Mega Millions jackpot was around $800 million. Alex's coworker bought about 20 tickets for an office pool, which Alex skipped, buying his own lucky ticket instead and joking his basil picked the numbers after holding the ticket to the leaves.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9831485-25e5-455a-a073-95155b6f4ba1",
          "memory": "Alex said if he won the lottery he would rent out Mario's restaurant every Saturday to give free pizzas to anyone who walks in, with unlimited garlic knots, saying he would rather be the Saturday pizza guy than buy a yacht or mansion.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8ad3571d-98c5-46e8-889b-c863329ae836",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 7, 2026, User was too tired to cook and ordered tacos from the taco truck near them known for a long line, noting they give a mountain of onions. User invited Alex to come try the truck sometime.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "59afe7a9-3aa0-48da-a94f-f2082429cc46",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, Alex ate leftover sad microwave rice and chicken with hot sauce to make it less sad while daydreaming about winning the lottery and heating up leftovers.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c08b92b9-4ff3-47a8-9baf-0a6779adf328",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, User had a long workday with back-to-back meetings until about 5:30 PM, while Alex had a boring afternoon of emails.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "1ae45b13-46ec-4697-ae0d-fdce9bf56b3d",
          "memory": "As of October 7, 2026, User still has a single mystery sock from the sock saga living on their dresser, joking with Alex about adopting it as a dust rag.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9b558495-4a5e-4c81-a664-876c25361601",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, Alex's mom asked if his basil was big enough for cooking yet and joked its current tiny size was a garnish for one noodle.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2c6452c-d843-422a-938f-f2589dc87a99",
          "memory": "User's dad has a running grill and burger lecture that User described on October 7, 2026 as eternal, joking he would rather talk about his grill for 2 hours than discuss free pizza.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
